    <string name="help_cloud_ai_get_key_title">How to Get DeepSeek API Key</string>
    <string name="help_cloud_ai_intro">Cloud translation uses online API for fast, high-quality results.</string>
    <string name="help_cloud_ai_steps">How to get DeepSeek API Key:
1. Visit https://platform.deepseek.com
2. Register with phone or email
3. After login, click avatar → "API Keys"
4. Click "Create API Key" and copy it
5. Paste into the "API Key" field below</string>
